    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n49949" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ustrīna</span></b> , ae, f.
		uro. * <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>A burning</i>, <i>burn</i>,
					<i><span class="en">App. M. 7, p. 196,
			30</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>A place for burning corpses</i>,
					<i><span class="en">Inscr. Orell. 4517</span></i>; cf. Fest.
			s. v. bustum, p. 32.—Called also ‡ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ustrī-num</span></b> ,
			i, n., <i><span class="en">Inscr. Grut.
				656, 3</span></i>; <i><span class="en">755, 4</span></i>; <i><span class="en">1044, 7
		al.</span></i></div>
